<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">A password reset was requested for your Koro account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">Set a new password</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">The link is valid for {{index .Data "valid_minutes"}} minutes and can be used once. If the app asks for a code, enter: <code>{{index .Data "token"}}</code></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Changing the password signs you out on every device.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">If you did not ask for this, ignore this message; your password stays the same.</p>
